/// The meta-schemas of JSON Schema's drafts 3, 4, 6 and 7, 2019-09 and 2020-12, and the
/// vocabularies of the last two, for std.json.schema: what `check_schema` validates a schema
/// against, and what a `$ref` to one of them finds.
module std.json.schema.meta

// They're the files python-jsonschema's jsonschema-specifications 2025.9.1 ships, as it ships them,
